$ gate-inbox wait -h
exit 0
--- stdout
usage: gate-inbox wait [<session-id>...] [--children] [--until <state>] [--timeout <duration>] [--json]
  -children
    	park on every session you spawned instead of naming ids; the first to arrive ends the wait and the result carries the whole set
  -json
    	print the raw result as JSON instead of a sentence
  -timeout duration
    	how long to wait before giving up, default 50s, maximum 2m0s
  -until value
    	state that ends the wait, repeatable or comma separated; defaults to every state meaning the session stopped working

