$ gate-inbox reserve -h
exit 0
--- stdout
usage: gate-inbox reserve <path>... [--mode exclusive|shared] [--note <text>] [--ttl <duration>] [--json]
  -json
    	print the raw result as JSON instead of a sentence
  -mode string
    	exclusive (default) means nobody else should edit these paths; shared means others may too
  -note string
    	what you are doing there, so a conflicting agent knows what it is up against
  -ttl duration
    	how long the lease lasts before it lapses, default 30m0s, maximum 4h0m0s

