$ gate-inbox terminal create -h
exit 0
--- stdout
usage: gate-inbox terminal create [--group <path>] [--directory <path>] [--nest=false] [--json]
  -directory string
    	existing directory to open; defaults to yours, or to the group's inherited path
  -group string
    	existing group path to open it in; pass an empty string for the root group
  -json
    	print the raw result as JSON instead of a sentence
  -nest
    	hang the terminal under this session; pass --nest=false to leave it loose or to open it in another group (default true)

